{"id":"Caf9dd280d8e3506111a0","zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"研究车辆与轨道相互作用及耦合振动的动力学理论。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C3cf0f6e7e87c8448be4f","zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"He349144807ae9f08c22c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"Cbc97a139dfeb4dfe5c9b","zh":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle–track coupled dynamics","domain":"系统与动力学","group_id":"He349144807ae9f08c22c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"系统与动力学 · Xu等（2017）"},{"id":"C91ca37ca7f638eb13702","zh":"车辆−轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle −track coupled dynamics","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"He349144807ae9f08c22c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2024）"},{"id":"Caf9dd280d8e3506111a0","zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"He349144807ae9f08c22c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2024）"},{"id":"Cafe5b7f6df0bab0d282b","zh":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学","en":"vehicle/track coupled dynamics","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"He349144807ae9f08c22c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D9466cd30fd27708ddf1a","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学"},{"id":"D01984deefc294108cdd4","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics"}],"sources":{"P131":{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S4d6f67c8b40d6727ea5c","source_id":"P131","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"摘要:为从车辆-轨道系统的动力极值预测及其可靠度计算角度分析车辆系统行车安全、衡量系统可靠程度,基于车辆- 轨道耦合动力学及概率理论,提出一种车轨系统动力极值预测及可靠度评估方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sa633489338a09f4b7282","source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"为此,本文将轨道不平顺概率模型与车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型相结合,通过建立轨道不平顺概率谱与系统动力响应极值之关系, 开展基于不同类型不平顺谱概率二维插值的车辆- 轨道系统动力响应极值预测及可靠度信息获取方法研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S77072d69f9b3b276c32d","source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Subsequently, by using vehicle-track coupled dynamics analysis and a two-dimensional interpolation operator, the dynamic response extremum was predicted based on the energy relationship of the PSD curves.","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S67ef1161b5264b7a220a","source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"By combining the track irregularity probabilistic model and vehicle-track coupled dynamics model, the dynamic extremes and reliability information of the vehicle-track system were extracted from the stochastic analysis.","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C6ff657c197dff469b7e6","target_concept_id":"C6ff657c197dff469b7e6","target_zh":"动力响应极值预测","target_en":"prediction of dynamic-response extremes","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_concept_id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_zh":"轨道不平顺概率模型","target_en":"track irregularity probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C099b7e117874add41e10","target_concept_id":"C099b7e117874add41e10","target_zh":"可靠度评估","target_en":"reliability assessment","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_concept_id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_zh":"概率模型","target_en":"probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_concept_id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_zh":"随机分析","target_en":"stochastic analysis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cc0128d2a1ad28f121d26","target_concept_id":"Cc0128d2a1ad28f121d26","target_zh":"动力学响应","target_en":"dynamic response","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"}]}